theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 30
text = "━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Sort LOWEST to HIGHEST.
The rightmost crate is the PIVOT.
Press COMPARE for each crate:
  < Pivot → moves to small zone
  >= Pivot → stays in place
When all compared, COMPARE
again to lock the pivot.
Then repeat on sub-partitions.
Orange = Pivot
Blue = Current compare
Green tint = Small zone
Gold = Sorted & locked"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

